Gold-standard Hi-C Stripes Dataset

This dataset, including 55 manually curated bulk Hi-C stripes, manifest files, patch matrices, and associated visualizations, is released under the CC BY 4.0 license.

You are free to:
- Share — copy and redistribute the dataset in any medium or format
- Adapt — remix, transform, and build upon the dataset for any purpose, even commercially

